So, I was trying to figure out how to say "tablet" in Lojban, as in a tablet
PC.

Since businesses sometimes list them in the E-Book section, I was thinking
of something along the lines of {cukta skami}.

Do you think this is a decent choice?

Also, for a lujvo, jvozba gives {ckuskami} or {samcku}, depending on which
gismu comes first.

Personally, I like {samcku} better, because it's shorter and slightly easier
to say, but I'd like your opinions.

Does anyone else have alternative ideas for what to call a tablet PC in
Lojban?

